    {
      "bbox": [
        176,
        913,
        1966,
        1277
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "As you are all aware, strict budget economies are necessary because of the critical fiscal situation. I am therefore asking that each department and agency head immediately review his 1965-1966 budget and list in reverse order of priority the programs, activities or expenditures constituting 10% of that budget which are of the lowest priority. The budget should be reviewed to determine what reductions would be made if the total budget were to be cut at the rate of 10% on an annual basis. The 10% should be based on your net total departmental appropriation.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.3412,
          "min": -1.6272
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 120,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0383
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 45310,
        "area_px": 611156,
        "density": 0.07414,
        "chars": 562,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.4
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        173,
        1317,
        1892,
        1587
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The objective of this analysis is to place in rank order, starting with the least important expenses first, those items which might be curtailed or eliminated. Your report should also explain the reasons for the ranking. It is recognized that cuts in personnel will occur, if the cuts suggested are followed, and the effect on the personal service staffing of your department should be carefully outlined.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2833,
          "min": -1.4706
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 75,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0087
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 31630,
        "area_px": 435226,
        "density": 0.07267,
        "chars": 405,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.8
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        169,
        1628,
        1933,
        1807
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This review should cover programs and activities partly financed by inter-governmental grants, as well as tax levy programs. In each case the amount of the loss in grants should be shown and the impact on the total program or activity should be described.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2874,
          "min": -1.6628
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 49,
          "mean": -0.0239,
          "min": -0.5968
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 21107,
        "area_px": 296460,
        "density": 0.0712,
        "chars": 255,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.08
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        165,
        1851,
        1889,
        2074
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "If some economy is desirable, or if some cutting back on the work force assigned to a particular activity is desirable, but this economy or reduction is presently barred by contractual arrangements or other constraints, these economies should nonetheless be listed in the ranking, but appropriate note made of the restriction.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2577,
          "min": -1.3853
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 56,
          "mean": -0.0003,
